"""Strategy register. win_prob = estimated probability (0-1) that a competent team executing the
strategy for 90-180 days on a site with sound fundamentals sees a measurable positive change in
the primary KPI. Estimates are calibrated to evidence grade and reported effect sizes; they are
expert judgments, not measured frequencies. impact/effort/risk are 1 (low) to 3 (high)."""
